     "es": "Zeus dio señales de que era un dios, y el pueblo empezó a rezarle.",
     "en": "Zeus showed signs that he was a god, and the people began to pray to him."
    },
    {
     "es": "Pero Licaón se burló y quiso ponerlo a prueba con un crimen terrible.",
     "en": "But Lycaon mocked him and wished to test him with a terrible crime."
