   "frases": [
    {
     "es": "Así renació la humanidad, nacida de la piedra de la Tierra.",
     "en": "So humanity was born anew, formed from the stone of the Earth."
    },
    {
     "es": "Pero Gea no perdonaba a los dioses por haber encerrado a sus hijos, los Titanes.",
     "en": "But Gaia would not forgive the gods for imprisoning her children, the Titans."
    },
    {
     "es": "Y preparaba un ejército de seres enormes para atacar el Olimpo.",
     "en": "And she was raising an army of colossal beings to storm Olympus."
    },
    {
     "es": "Esa es la próxima historia: la Gigantomaquia.",
     "en": "That is the next story: the Gigantomachy."
    }
